{"4353190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FJN Roulette Cup", "steam_appid": 4353190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>TOURNAMENT MODE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FJN Roulette Cup features an exciting knockout roulette tournament.  Make betting decisions as you try to earn as many chips as possible before the end of the tournament.  Climb the tournament leaderboards and compete for the championship against your tournament rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a play-by-play commentary system as you make tough decisions before each roulette spin.  Stay tuned in to the tournament as you make progress and battle for position with other tournament competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic roulette betting board with fast spins,  classic betting options,  and the opportunity to win big prizes and earn Steam Achievements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ROULETTE GAME ENGINE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play roulette on one of the most realistic roulette simulation engines ever built.  Experience what it's like to play professional roulette and make tough betting decisions along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic casino atmosphere with roulette physics that are realistic and engaging.  Featuring high quality textures and animations in the high definition render pipeline and new DirectX 12 integration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAME FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Roulette Physics Engine </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tournament Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HDRP Graphics Engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play-by-Play Commentary </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragra